License: OFL-1.1
 This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
 .
 The full text is installed with each font it covers, under
 /usr/share/glitchvape/assets/fonts/, and on Debian systems a copy is also at
 /usr/share/common-licenses/OFL-1.1 where the base-files version provides one.
 `glitchvape --licenses` prints the installed copies.

License: LicenseRef-VCR-OSD-Mono
 The author has granted use of this font for any purpose, commercial and
 non-commercial alike, with no conditions attached. There is no licence
 document; the grant and its source are recorded in
 /usr/share/glitchvape/assets/fonts/VCROSD/LICENSE, which is installed with
 the font and which `glitchvape --licenses` prints.

License: LicenseRef-Unverified
 The terms of this font have not been established. It is redistributed here
 on the strength of a font aggregator's description of it, which is not a
 licence, and it is packaged separately from everything else for that reason.
 /usr/share/glitchvape/assets/fonts-nonfree/W95FA/LICENSE records what is
 known, what is missing, and what would settle it.
 .
 If you need certainty about what you may do with this font, obtain it from
 its author rather than from this package.
